#: includes/class-eclair-export-diagnostic.php:299
msgid "%s redirections use regular expressions: Éclair only redirects exact addresses, they will be listed to be rewritten."
msgstr "%s redirecciones usan expresiones regulares: Éclair solo redirige direcciones exactas, se listarán para reescribirlas."

